          "labBehaviour": "for BigIntValue, CircularReference and SerializationFailed detail is \"Expected a JSON-serializable value\", the message of the schema issue the S.fromJsonString codec reports; code still names the cause and equals upstream's for bigints (primitive or boxed) and cycles; TopLevelUnrepresentable keeps upstream's sentence",
          "reason": "law:13 (schema transformations over ad-hoc serialization) plus the JSON-codec rule of standards/effect-first-development.md:104 / effect-first skill law 22 (never JSON.parse or JSON.stringify; use schema JSON codecs): only a direct JSON.stringify inside a try can observe the thrown message, and the codec's getter discards it"
        },
