          "upstreamBehaviour": "every caught TypeError is classified by matching its message against /circular|cyclic/i and /bigint/i, so a toJSON or getter that throws TypeError(\"my bigint thing\") returns a typed BigIntValue failure with the caller's message as detail, and TypeError(\"circular dependency\") returns CircularReference",
