          "upstreamBehaviour": "tabSize is Schema.optionalKey(Schema.Number) on JsoncStringifyOptions and JsoncFormattingOptions, so NaN and the infinities are accepted: stringifyResult reads NaN and -Infinity as compact and Infinity as ten spaces; with insertSpaces true, format and modify read NaN as no indent and fail with a RangeError for either infinity",
