│   ├── workflow/
│   └── ...
├── index.ts              # Main export file
└── [module].ts           # 122+ top-level modules (flat structure)
```

### Flat Module Structure

The Effect library uses a **flat module structure** where core modules are top-level `.ts` files:

```text
packages/effect/src/
├── Array.ts
├── BigDecimal.ts
├── Boolean.ts
├── Brand.ts
├── Cache.ts
