/home/elpresidank/YeeBois/references/effect/effect/packages/effect/SCHEMA.md:2237:Use `Schema.suspend` when a schema needs to refer to itself (or to another schema that eventually refers back). `suspend` wraps a thunk, so the recursive reference is resolved lazily during decode / encode instead of eagerly during declaration.
