commit 4ba902dc2b9cff84eabfbfc4ba133cdbc605be39
Author: elpresidank <benjamin@krieg.cloud>
Date:   Thu Oct 8 23:15:48 2026 -0500

    refactor(scratchpad): jsonl review round 1 (effected-port S4)
    
    Round 1 on e0500aea7d: grok 0/0, sol 2/0, fable 5/4; seven required.
    
    Source: a read and the seed take the BOM width, size and identity through
    one handle, so a rename-over can no longer pair one file's width with
    another's identity; a journal that vanishes at any seed step constructs as
    missing; the tail scans bytes with the typed-array natives again.
    
    Tests: upstream's Schema.Class patch cases and its capacity-1 close-ordering
    case are restored, the concurrent-patch case holds the first patch inside
    the write permit, and every property takes its run count from fcRuns.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

